{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"632dd4147026fa600518a3f00c24b6fa8a338b17185b54576ae9104ec0242142","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":22,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["关于耶路撒冷的预言"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["以下是关于异象谷",{"noteId":11},"的预言：",{"text":"为什么你们全都上到房顶呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们这座充满喧闹、骚动和欢乐的城啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们中间被杀的人既非丧身刀下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也非死于战场。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的官长都一起逃跑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一箭未发便束手就缚，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"逃到远方的也一同被擒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，我说：“你们不要管我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"让我痛哭吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要安慰我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的同胞都被毁灭了。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主——万军之耶和华已经定了日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要使异象谷饱受恐慌、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"失败和混乱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"城墙被攻破，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"哭喊声响彻山间。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以拦人带着箭袋，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"率领战车和骑兵前来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吉珥人也亮出盾牌。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们佳美的山谷中布满战车，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"骑兵在你们的城门前列阵。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主除去了犹大的防卫。","poem":1},"那时，你们寄望于藏在林宫里的兵器。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["你们看见大卫城破口累累，你们储存下池的水，"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["数点耶路撒冷城的房屋，把房屋拆掉修补城墙。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["你们又在两道城墙之间建造新的蓄水池，用来盛旧池的水。耶和华从古时已定了这一切，要使这一切发生，但你们既不仰望祂，也不理会祂。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"那日，主——万军之耶和华要你们哭泣哀号，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"剃光头发，身披麻衣。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但你们却欢喜作乐，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"宰牛杀羊，喝酒吃肉，说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“让我们吃喝吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为明天我们就死了。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"万军之耶和华启示我说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“你们这罪到死也得不到赦免。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是主——万军之耶和华说的。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["主——万军之耶和华吩咐我去见宫廷总管舍伯那，对他说："]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["“你在这里做什么？你凭什么在这里为自己挖坟墓，在高处为自己挖坟墓，在磐石上为自己凿安息之所？"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["看啊，你这有权有势的人，耶和华必紧紧抓住你，把你猛力抛出去。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["祂必把你揉作一团，像球一样扔到宽阔之地。在那里，你必死亡，你华美的战车也必遭毁灭，你是你主人家的羞辱。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["耶和华对舍伯那说：“我必解除你的官职，把你从高位上拉下来。"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["“到那日，我必召来希勒迦的儿子——我的仆人以利亚敬，"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["给他穿上你的朝服，系上你的腰带，把你的权柄交给他。他必像父亲一样保护耶路撒冷的居民和犹大人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["我必把大卫家的钥匙放在他的肩头。他开启的，没有人能关；他关闭的，没有人能开。"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["我要使他像深嵌在坚固之处的橛子一样稳固，他必给他的家族带来尊荣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["他的家族及其子孙后代都靠他得荣耀，如同杯子和酒瓶等小器皿挂在一个橛子上。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["万军之耶和华说：“到那日，牢牢钉在坚固之处的橛子必松动，被砍落在地上，挂在上面的东西必被除掉。这是耶和华说的。”"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":11,"caller":"+","text":"“异象谷”指耶路撒冷。","reference":{"chapter":22,"verse":1}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/22.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/23.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/21.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":25}